---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How Heat Pump Wise handles data and cookies.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="post">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>Updated July 2026.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site uses self-hosted Plausible Analytics. It records aggregate pageviews and referrer strings. It does not set cookies, does not collect IPs on a per-user basis, and does not sell or share data with anyone.</p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>Some outbound links are affiliate links. Retailers see that a visitor came from this site. They do not see which visitor, what you bought, or your account. They cannot track you back here.</p>
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>If you write in, your email address sits in my inbox folder. I do not paste it into a spreadsheet, sell it, or add it to a list.</p>
      <h2>Comments</h2>
      <p>There is no comment system on this site. If you want to argue with me, send email.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>